ass=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">Single core</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">109</p><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mt-1\">100<!-- -->w</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl bg-surface-alt border border-line px-4 py-3 min-w-[100px] text-center\"><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted mb-1\">gpu</p><p class=\"text-xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">23,189</p></div></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Unigine Heaven</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">10,828</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">429.9</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">285w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">8,650</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">343.4</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">285w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">4k</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">4,047</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">160.7</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">285w</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted mb-3\">Furmark</p><table class=\"w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left text-xs text-ink-muted border-b border-line\"><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium w-16\">Res</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">Score</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium\">FPS</th><th class=\"pb-2 font-medium text-right\">Power</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1080p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">16,965</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">282.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">285w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">1440p</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">12,786</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">213.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">285w</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-line/50 last:border-0\"><td class=\"py-2 text-ink-muted font-medium\">4k</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums\">6,453</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums font-medium\">107.0</td><td class=\"py-2 tabular-nums text-right text-ink-muted\">285w</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-6\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink mb-4\">Builder notes</h2><p class=\"text-sm text-ink leading-relaxed whitespace-pre-line\">Midori 5L-V2.2 is the successor to the original Midori 5L with improved full motherboard and GPU IO access. At 5.40L, it maintains the 2-slot wide GPU limit while accommodating GPUs up to 261mm long. The case does not officially support modular Flex-ATX PSUs due to single standoff mounting, requiring creative installation. No PCIe riser cable included; an 18.0-18.5cm double reverse PCIe 4.0 cable was sourced from AliExpress. Assembly is challenging with tight screw and nut locations requiring needle-nose pliers. The INNO3D RTX 4070ti SUPER Twin X2 (250mm, 2.0-slot) proved to be an excellent fit for this compact form factor. CPU power limits set to P1: 60w and P2: 100w work well with the Noctua NH-L9i-17xx cooler. Performance is excellent for the compact footprint with the i5-13600T and RTX 4070ti SUPER providing solid 1440p gaming capability. Advantages over original Midori 5L include direct IO access, stronger WiFi signal via integrated antenna, improved organization, and dual 92mm exhaust fans. Disadvantages include difficult assembly with nuts and screws in tight spaces, and GPU slot thickness limitations. Recommended for moderate to experienced mini-ITX builders. Case demonstrates potential for long-term use but builders remain limited to low to mid-tier components due to tight space constraints.</p></section></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><section class=\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\">Performance</h2><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">CPU — CB23 Multi</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">13,331</p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-accent\" style=\"width:41%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->59<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">133.3</span> pts/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">9<!-- -->°C</span> headroom</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\">GPU — Heaven 1080p</p><p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\">429.9<!-- --> <span class=\"text-base font-normal text-ink-muted\">fps</span></p><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\"><div class=\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full bg-sff-green\" style=\"width:79%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\">top <!-- -->21<!-- -->%</span></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\"><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\">1.51</span> fps/w</span><span><span class=\"font-medium text-ink\"